/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Involuntary Loss of Employment insurance is a unique scheme that covers workers in the federal government sector and the private sector in the United Arab Emirates. It aims to compensate the insured with a cash amount for a maximum period of three months per claim when they lose their job, provided that the job loss was not a result of resignation or a disciplinary action as per the policy terms and conditions.)
/E (The Involuntary Loss of Employment insurance is a unique scheme that covers workers in the federal government sector and the private sector in the United Arab Emirates. It aims to compensate the insured with a cash amount for a maximum period of three months per claim when they lose their job, provided that the job loss was not a result of resignation or a disciplinary action as per the policy terms and conditions.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
